{"id":5134,"date":"2018-11-21T13:47:31","date_gmt":"2018-11-21T18:47:31","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=5134"},"modified":"2018-11-19T21:49:11","modified_gmt":"2018-11-20T02:49:11","slug":"casa-grande-ruins-national-monument","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2018\/11\/21\/casa-grande-ruins-national-monument\/","title":{"rendered":"Casa Grande Ruins National Monument"},"content":{"rendered":"<figure id=\"attachment_5136\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5136\" style=\"width: 3024px\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_114015.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-5136 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_114015-e1542680671371.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3024\" height=\"4032\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_114015-e1542680671371.jpg 405w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_114015-e1542680671371-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_114015-e1542680671371-768x1024.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 3024px) 100vw, 3024px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5136\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Entrance to the compound with the Great House in the background. Note the bird nest holes in the cactus on the right.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>Throughout the southwest, and specifically Arizona, there are many sites of ruins from early native peoples.<a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/Ruins-Map.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright size-medium wp-image-5137\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/Ruins-Map-272x300.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"272\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/Ruins-Map-272x300.png 272w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/Ruins-Map.png 524w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 272px) 100vw, 272px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Last week we took a short drive from our winter home at Rover&#8217;s Roost RV Park in Casa Grande, Arizona on over to Coolidge where we visited the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.nps.gov\/cagr\/learn\/historyculture\/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Casa Grande Ruins National Monument.<\/a><\/p>\n<p>The other ruins we&#8217;ve visited in Arizona have been home to cliff-dwelling peoples (<a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2016\/09\/28\/is-it-really-a-castle\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">see this link to our other visits<\/a>) while this one was home to Sonoran Desert farmers.\u00a0 In the center of the community is the &#8220;Great House&#8221; and the foundations of other smaller buildings and meeting and work areas surround the larger structure.\u00a0 Further out from the walls of the community were an impressive network of large and small canals for crop irrigation.<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/Compound-A-Drawing-1.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5144 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/Compound-A-Drawing-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"650\" height=\"156\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/Compound-A-Drawing-1.jpg 650w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/Compound-A-Drawing-1-300x72.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 650px) 100vw, 650px\" \/><\/a>The Sonoran people abandoned (for unknown reasons) the area about 1450 A.D. archeologists tell us while the area was first visited by non-native people around 1690.<\/p>\n<p>Here are some pictures of our visit, but you can find more information about the ruins <a href=\"https:\/\/www.nps.gov\/cagr\/learn\/historyculture\/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">by clicking here<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>As always, you can click on any picture to get an enlarged view to see more detail.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5141\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5141\" style=\"width: 3024px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121218.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-5141 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121218-e1542681279411.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"3024\" height=\"4032\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121218-e1542681279411.jpg 405w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121218-e1542681279411-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121218-e1542681279411-768x1024.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 3024px) 100vw, 3024px\" \/><\/a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5141\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">The wood beam and metal bar are recent efforts to reinforce the wall to keep it from falling<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_120928.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright size-full wp-image-5138\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_120928.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"2592\" height=\"1458\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_120928.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_120928-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_120928-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_120928-1024x576.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2592px) 100vw, 2592px\" \/><\/a> <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121048.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright size-medium wp-image-5139\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121048-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121048-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121048-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121048-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121048.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a> <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121116.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright size-medium wp-image-5140\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121116-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121116-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121116-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121116-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121116.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121626.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-5142 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121626.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121626.jpg 720w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121626-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121626-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/20181117_121626-1024x768.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 4032px) 100vw, 4032px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Thanks for riding along with us.<\/p>\n<p>Take Care of yourselves and our best wishes to you wherever you might be.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Throughout the southwest, and specifically Arizona, there are many sites of ruins from early native peoples. Last week we took a short drive from our winter home at Rover&#8217;s Roost RV Park in Casa Grande, Arizona on over to Coolidge where we visited the Casa Grande Ruins National Monument. The other ruins we&#8217;ve visited in &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2018\/11\/21\/casa-grande-ruins-national-monument\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Casa Grande Ruins National Monument<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[19546,554707329],"tags":[24592,554707625,162879,554707624,554707627,554707279,554707628,554707626,23317,554707622,554707623,14157],"class_list":["post-5134","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-sightseeing","category-traveling","tag-arizona","tag-canal","tag-casa-grande","tag-castle","tag-crops","tag-desert","tag-farming","tag-irrigation","tag-museum","tag-ruins","tag-sonoran","tag-water"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5134","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5134"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5134\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5149,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/w